# Turn to Frog's ruling: a creature it affects that stops being a creature keeps its other types and is blue with no abilities,
# but no Frog - a creature type is had only by a creature or a Kindred (CR 205.3d; "If it stops being a creature ... it will
# be a legendary blue enchantment with no abilities"). On turn 4 Bot2 turns Bot1's Opalescence-animated Humility into a
# Frog, then disenchants Opalescence: Humility is no creature now - a blue enchantment with no subtype - and it still has
# no abilities until end of turn (a resolved effect on it, CR 611.2c), so Bot1's Inspiring Overseer is still its printed
# 2/1 with flying.

